:Class Grid
⍝ This class provides two public functions:
⍝ * `CreateParms` creates a parameter space
⍝ * `CreateGrid` returns a ref pointing to a grid.
⍝ Note that any Grid instance create by `CreateGrid` depends on the class `GridCallbacks`.

⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝⍝ See function #._APLGUI.GUI.test for "testing" the Grid.


    ∇ parms←CreateParms parent
    ⍝ Right argument must be a reference pointing to either a Form or a SubForm.
      :Access Public Shared
      parms←##.APLGuiParameterSpace.Create
    ⍝ | Name        | Description                                                                                   |
    ⍝ | ------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
    ⍝ | `coord`     | Default is `Prop`                                                                             |
    ⍝ | `dataTypes` | Mandatory. Defines the data types of the columns. See `Enums.GridDataTypes`                   |
    ⍝ | `font`      | Default to "APL385 Unicode" with a size of 20 pixels.                                         |
    ⍝ | `gridParms` | No default. Use this to specify your own parameters. They take precedence over any defaults.  |
    ⍝ | `parent`    | Mandatory. Typically a form or a sub form.                                                    |
    ⍝ | `posn`      | Default is `(0 0)`                                                                            |
    ⍝ | `size`      | Default is `(100 100)`                                                                        |
    ⍝ | ``          |
      parms.coord←'Prop'
      parms.dataTypes←⍬
      parms.font←('PName' 'APL385 Unicode')('Size' 20)
      parms.gridParms←⍬
      parms.parent←parent
      parms.posn←0 0
      parms.size←100 100
    ∇

    ∇ grid←{values}CreateGrid parms;∆
      :Access Public Shared
      'Right argument is not a parameter space'⎕SIGNAL 11/⍨9.1≠⎕NC⊂'parms'
      'Parameter space does not have a "parent" property'⎕SIGNAL 11/⍨9≠parms.⎕NC'parent'
      :Trap 0
          '"parent" property does not specify a Form or SubForm'⎕SIGNAL 11/⍨'Form' 'SubForm'⍷⍨parms.parent ⎕WG'Type'
      :Else
          'Invalid "parent" property'⎕SIGNAL 11
      :EndTrap
      'Property "dataType" is not defined'⎕SIGNAL 11/⍨0∊⍴parms.dataTypes
      'Property "dataType" is invalid'⎕SIGNAL 11/⍨~∧/parms.dataTypes∊##.Enums.GridDataTypes.∆List
      ∆←''
      ∆,←⊂'Coord'parms.coord
      ∆,←⊂'Posn'parms.posn
      ∆,←⊂'Size'parms.size
      ∆,←⊂'ShowInput' 1
      ∆,←⊂'ResizeCols' 1
      :If 0≠≢parms.gridParms
          ∆,←parms.gridParms
      :EndIf
      grid←parms.parent.⎕NEW'Grid'∆
      :If 0≠≢parms.font
          grid.FontObj←grid.⎕NEW'Font'parms.font
      :EndIf
      :If 0<⎕NC'values'
          grid.Values←values
      :EndIf
      grid(CreateInputControl)←parms
      grid { ⎕NQ ⍺'SetColSize'⍵ ¯3}¨⍳1⊃⍴values
     ⍝Done
    ∇


    ∇ grid←grid CreateInputControl parms;dataType;dt
      dt←##.Enums.GridDataTypes
      :For dataType :In parms.dataTypes
          :Select dataType
          :Case dt.Char
              grid.Input,←grid.⎕NEW⊂'Edit'
          :Case dt.Currency
              grid.Input,←grid.⎕NEW'Edit'(⊂('FieldType' 'Currency'))
          :Case dt.Date
              grid.Input,←grid.⎕NEW'DateTimePicker'(,⊂'CustomFormat'('yyyy''-''mm''-''dd'))
          :Case dt.DateTime
              grid.Input,←grid.⎕NEW'DateTimePicker'(,⊂'CustomFormat'('yyyy''-''mm''-''dd'' ''hh'':''mm'':''ss'))
          :Case dt.DropDown
              grid.Input,←grid.⎕NEW⊂'DropDown'
          :Case dt.DropEdit
              grid.Input,←grid.⎕NEW⊂'DropEdit'
          :Case dt.Numeric
              grid.Input,←grid.⎕NEW'Edit'(⊂'FieldType' 'Numeric')
          :Case dt.Time
              .
          :Case dt.YesNo
              grid.Input,←grid.⎕NEW'Button'(⊂'Style' 'Check')
          :Else
              . ⍝ Huuh?!
          :EndSelect
      :EndFor
      grid.CellTypes←(⍴grid.Values)⍴1+⍳⍴grid.Input
    ∇

:EndClass
